{"title":"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by The Power of Logic</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Challenge_25\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Challenge 25</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_Steakmath\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by Steakmath</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/b/3/8b369a2b01d88f6512e31b0d046d530ba8588588.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1\\leq x_2\\leq \\cdots\\leq x_{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"163\" height=\"16\" /> be real numbers such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/614a1cee3d7cb6dd7880c10e5c86947c9b996161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x_1| + |x_2| + \\cdots + |x_{100}| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71a88f690f53df9abac7e414a875823a594cc7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{100} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"17\" />. Among all such <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/5/9/e59e2c6e83eb78cca610a5fd4070ae01c8d4ae60.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"29\" height=\"14\" />-tuples of numbers, the greatest value that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8cf40cf8a382773dbfeff18dcba5e7bd0f43897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} - x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" /> can achieve is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/c/3/cc39f6ba583f6159aadcb898b5f7677688db8f89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\tfrac mn$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"14\" height=\"18\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/5/0/f5047d1e0cbb50ec208923a22cd517c55100fa7b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/7/4/174fadd07fd54c9afe288e96558c92e0c1da733a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"13\" height=\"10\" /> are relatively prime positive integers. Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/d/02dbab3601fa6cce490d54263017048f69e1a35d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"51\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>To find the greatest value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8cf40cf8a382773dbfeff18dcba5e7bd0f43897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} - x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72b1849e3868e7b24e98ddc504348bf10993904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> must be as large as possible, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30595370d33ddb23d4c8488d137efe9f292b543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> must be as small as possible. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72b1849e3868e7b24e98ddc504348bf10993904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> is as large as possible, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/3/e/d3eafd77b236610bf82590eb0c545462d792f658.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} = x_{77} = x_{78} = \\dots = x_{100} &gt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"258\" height=\"17\" />. If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30595370d33ddb23d4c8488d137efe9f292b543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> is as small as possible, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/9/d79cea4c8f9fe2a3458358be7e0ed84138c7ea3a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16} = x_{15} = x_{14} = \\dots = x_{1} &lt; 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"245\" height=\"17\" />. The other numbers between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30595370d33ddb23d4c8488d137efe9f292b543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72b1849e3868e7b24e98ddc504348bf10993904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />. Let <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/4/bc4d615418abe8e427e69190fba8d116586babed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"60\" height=\"13\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/7/f97b8af94cb5b2e24efef80011c8217914a296a0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"58\" height=\"17\" />. Substituting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/7/d/c7d457e388298246adb06c587bccd419ea67f7e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/3/8136a7ef6a03334a7246df9097e5bcc31ba33fd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"14\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/1/4/614a1cee3d7cb6dd7880c10e5c86947c9b996161.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|x_1| + |x_2| + \\cdots + |x_{100}| = 1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"220\" height=\"20\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/a/71a88f690f53df9abac7e414a875823a594cc7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 + x_2 + \\cdots + x_{100} = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"190\" height=\"17\" /> we get:\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/c/f/5cffa6fa12137cbc55ba3923be4d11bca8b88ed0.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[25a - 16b = 1\\]\" width=\"107\" height=\"13\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/8/4586470ea588f8afa8bfeb07a591e63b2f5d0b94.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[25a + 16b = 0\\]\" width=\"108\" height=\"14\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/9/a/b9a67aef77a80d24ce0446607191f00efbb8475a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{1}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"58\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/7/2d7f68ff66474a7fe16e9984945617e4229dc67a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b = -\\frac{1}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"70\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/0/60073881208d313cf598aaad585f12bba2f78569.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} - x_{16} = a - b = \\frac{1}{50} + \\frac{1}{32} = \\frac{41}{800}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"283\" height=\"38\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/2/0/d20c4473b7ab95793118a8f8b8c7ba65ca4fa4ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$m+n = \\boxed{\\textbf{841}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"115\" height=\"24\" />\n</p><p>~<a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php/User:Isabelchen\">isabelchen</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Define <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebb25f78e509bd7d344981884394d69d4ccef94d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"13\" /> to be the sum of all the negatives, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8ad6f5db7025226837100a067c43b05c0c40d41a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> to be the sum of all the positives.\n</p><p>Since the sum of the absolute values of all the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/5/e/95ed2ce31786d58f9486b8e6efdfa22e64f27fe6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|s_N|+|s_P|=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"118\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Since the sum of all the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/c/8fc479010435f3c3bedf111ef772207f8314206b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_N=-s_P\\implies |s_N|=|s_P|$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"216\" height=\"20\" />.\n</p><p>Therefore, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/e/37eabc6da3ff22cbdbca9f71c3d41f3b0605ad41.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|s_N|=|s_P|=\\frac 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"124\" height=\"38\" />, so <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/0/ac04f2b784ae0343cb8a6dd77e0b6f2fa5cb786e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_N=-\\frac 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"74\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/8/d/e8dbab954ddd4e248d37331ce0ef4d935a623d78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_P=\\frac 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"59\" height=\"38\" /> since <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/b/ebb25f78e509bd7d344981884394d69d4ccef94d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_N$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"23\" height=\"13\" /> is negative and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/d/8ad6f5db7025226837100a067c43b05c0c40d41a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$s_P$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"21\" height=\"13\" /> is positive.\n</p><p>To maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/4/7/e47f2be89f0dc0bd4b856b64e35320b723d26692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}-x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />, we need to make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30595370d33ddb23d4c8488d137efe9f292b543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> as small of a negative as possible, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72b1849e3868e7b24e98ddc504348bf10993904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> as large of a positive as possible.\n</p><p>Note that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/4/2/4426c4593e577bc25515cbb5e486cceede9c4857.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}+x_{77}+\\cdots+x_{100}=\\frac 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"207\" height=\"38\" /> is greater than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/2/8/428a4cb52ab519ebb80817d79a85e6a532338179.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" /> because the numbers are in increasing order.\n</p><p>Similarly, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/b/6/eb6cc09750c2cfd72363b2f86c12ace99e47fd10.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{1}+x_{2}+\\cdots+x_{16}=-\\frac 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"201\" height=\"38\" /> is less than or equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/c/48c32e28c904c4fb45b046b740cedb882f8dabce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"44\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p>So we now know that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/6/b/66b1d879ae87c3e0b6fac1556eb99290975df0a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac 1{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> is the best we can do for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72b1849e3868e7b24e98ddc504348bf10993904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/e/d/bedca5a3f8bf8cc4d25e214feefc894ef58bd015.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac 1{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" /> is the least we can do for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30595370d33ddb23d4c8488d137efe9f292b543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" />.\n</p><p>Finally, the maximum value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/f/a/efa64ebb20906e0a98c92aa7e5041edc37c842e9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}-x_{16}=\\frac 1{50}+\\frac 1{32}=\\frac{41}{800}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"219\" height=\"38\" />, so the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/b/3/bb3b52869a3bce2042dfbe9399b2448d1d510fe7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{841}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"39\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>(Indeed, we can easily show that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/a/5/3a57520d53303e513850d92230b9fc2b7533ed7a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1=x_2=\\cdots=x_{16}=-\\frac 1{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"216\" height=\"38\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/6/7/467624686e92e0a15964df3ebb8927da42b2fbd2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{17}=x_{18}=\\cdots=x_{75}=0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"202\" height=\"17\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/5/a15e7d44cdbde5875f15673968604d985a7e1ae3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}=x_{77}=\\cdots=x_{100}=\\frac 1{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"222\" height=\"38\" /> works.)\n</p><p>~inventivedant\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Because the absolute value sum of all the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/c/e/dce34f4dfb2406144304ad0d6106c5382ddd1446.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, and the normal sum of all the numbers is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, the positive numbers must add to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/c/bdc960c165b21ba43f7a90caa2893d40409d6944.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> and negative ones must add to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/4/c2424e697f31d7d3c9424b1d2c208000c3decd01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\dfrac12$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"29\" height=\"38\" />. To maximize <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/8/c/d8cf40cf8a382773dbfeff18dcba5e7bd0f43897.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} - x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"73\" height=\"15\" />, we must make <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72b1849e3868e7b24e98ddc504348bf10993904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> as big as possible and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30595370d33ddb23d4c8488d137efe9f292b543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> as small as possible. We can do this by making <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/a/c/dac6476d7cabd5cf2223e11d3c138884b933a22c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 + x_2 + x_3 \\dots x_{16} = -\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"203\" height=\"38\" />, where <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/5/c256ef81a2ce38f68070ae1924ca98e4fef92cdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_1 = x_2 = x_3 = \\dots = x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"198\" height=\"13\" /> (because that makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30595370d33ddb23d4c8488d137efe9f292b543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> the smallest possible value), and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/e/0/2e06b0847f4ddb7d56c90a9ac0b8c41bdc5e00f3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} + x_{77} + x_{78} + \\dots + x_{100} = \\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"254\" height=\"38\" />, where similarly <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/e/c9efbb542b9d7941da2c44881ce7f7d0fd30a544.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} = x_{77} = \\dots = x_{100}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"176\" height=\"13\" /> (because it makes <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72b1849e3868e7b24e98ddc504348bf10993904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> its biggest possible value.) That means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/5/91539b8c68aefa95a9982d9859655a9ed23c5f52.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$16(x_{16}) = -\\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"110\" height=\"38\" />, and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/5/ea50f834238710421c6652b00b609a77e5a3ec88.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$25(x_{76}) = \\dfrac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"96\" height=\"38\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/2/2/a22fc3ad9fb1c16c170bb0421ec52d6b4059f17d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16} = -\\dfrac{1}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"87\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a249b33f8d3796e6ad772ccde6d513700adff0a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} = \\dfrac{1}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" />, and subtracting them <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/a/1/ba15461db97beba0578411ad58e92e411791d304.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\dfrac{1}{50} - \\left( -\\dfrac{1}{32}\\right) = \\dfrac{41}{800}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -18px\" width=\"164\" height=\"45\" />. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/8/ab807fa19a9f395b93fa63baf4cbd6a74d406568.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$41 + 800 = 841$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"121\" height=\"15\" />.\n</p><p>~heheman\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All positive terms sum to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/f/9/2f960094315d60883495f9b74148e17487ee9584.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"15\" height=\"38\" /> and all negative to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/8/5/c853bfb15f8cf5a622c714ab9586566175ef5a90.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{-1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"25\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p><p><b>Lemma 1:</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/a/2/0a22a29cac45a4d282c47f06260096f2ec35fc3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16} \\geq \\frac{-1}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"78\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p><b>Proof of Lemma 1:</b> We require <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/0/5/30595370d33ddb23d4c8488d137efe9f292b543f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"23\" height=\"10\" /> minimal and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/7/2/a72b1849e3868e7b24e98ddc504348bf10993904.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> as maximal, which implies because the sequence is increasing, we must set all terms between <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/7/a/07ad28c17a33bf7fef49d2075d271c46a8ebc0f2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{17}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/3/2/a32d0b0e28fae66dbaab9d2ff7fa814de65e34b8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{75}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"26\" height=\"13\" /> as a constant <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" />. It is obvious this <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db496a2fade0867e2dedc83ca9cf6262560559a1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c = 0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"43\" height=\"14\" />. Assume it wasn't, and then if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> is positive, we have to subtract some <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/f/a/7faca48d9ccf3badda4be02f90c3d3f05b307984.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$nc$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"21\" height=\"10\" /> from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/9/2/192b4a258ee998961a99523fd0f0a029f9ea194a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0.5$\" width=\"22\" height=\"12\" /> and same cases appear for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/3/7/3372c1cb6d68cf97c2d231acc0b47b95a9ed04cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$c$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"10\" height=\"10\" /> negative or a combination of both. It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/e/7/de7fd1d0b7bafc2e88de4b96ead70c64c9e1107e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{16} \\geq -\\frac{\\frac{1}{2}}{16} = \\frac{-1}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"138\" height=\"42\" /> as desired.\n</p><p><b>Lemma 2:</b> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/7/fa799b4e0653575f604dcc63556219799587a696.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_{76} \\leq \\frac{1}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"73\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>For space management, the proof of Lemma 2 is similar to that of Lemma 1.\n</p><p>Then, set all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/7/b/67bc6daa9d6b964201d6cef60cbeb1ac5fd26ead.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_i$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"15\" height=\"10\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/8/c/98ce0f4ddbbb2ada3a450ea08495922aceea8e4b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1 \\leq i \\leq 16$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"84\" height=\"16\" /> equal and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/c/0/ac0e6fa105993ce976db0dc241d59ab8e68e6efc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x_j$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"19\" height=\"15\" /> for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/b/fcb1f526a97f653272be152f6a1ce01eda4b7bf6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$76 \\leq j \\leq 100$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"104\" height=\"17\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/7/1/d71f1cff6378e00c4345fe7b7d8cf0f997526dc9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$-\\frac{1}{32}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"38\" height=\"38\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/2/3423afe40eb71ccb8b9d670383b3c5af8a82e75f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{50}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"24\" height=\"38\" /> respectively, The maximal difference is then <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/1/5/715ffc76b8ca595524349ec19708898312abb118.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{41}{800} \\implies \\boxed{841} \\quad \\square$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"152\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>~Pinotation\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_The_Power_of_Logic\">Video Solution by The Power of Logic</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by The Power of Logic\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/edpZKDxMsAc\">https://youtu.be/edpZKDxMsAc</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Challenge_25\">Video Solution by Challenge 25</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Challenge 25\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OQ8QcJB2hEA\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=OQ8QcJB2hEA</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_Steakmath\">Video Solution by Steakmath</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by Steakmath\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/enxMhNvZQ5Q\">https://youtu.be/enxMhNvZQ5Q</a>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II\" title=\"2022 AIME II\">2022 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2022 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2022\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2022_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2022 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018001908\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.062 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.079 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 588/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 18436/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.900      1 -total\n 58.65%    8.153      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.75%    5.525      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:21810:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018001908 and revision id 293488. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}